 "changed_since_previous": "Rebased on updated base PR #16545; the separate rpcauth parsing fix mentioned in the original description was merged separately in #30401.",
 "card": "Adds the ALLOW_LIST flag to ArgsManager and enforces at runtime that multi-value options are accessed via GetArgs() rather than GetArg(). This eliminates internal developer footguns where single-value accessors return inconsistent or unexpected elements from multi-value lists, and resolves position-dependent handling of empty -blockfilterindex arguments. It unblocks follow-up work in #17493 to reject ambiguous duplicate config settings. The PR is stacked on base PR #16545.",
